@startuml er-crm
' Propósito: modelo relacional del módulo crm — modelo FINAL (12 entidades): Person + dos hilos de vida separados (lead/customer) con catálogos configurables, matriz de transiciones, identifiers multicanal, assignment (round-robin), historiales inmutables y timeline polimórfico
' Última actualización: 2026-05-31 (modelo final: +transition tables, FKs forward sin constraint ADR-009, historiales/activity sin SoftDelete)
' Código de referencia: backend/app/modules/crm/models/

!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide circle
hide empty members

title ER — Backend · CRM module

legend top right
  | <#FFFFE0> Marker | Significado |
  | * | NOT NULL |
  | <<PK>> | Primary Key |
  | <<FK>> | Foreign Key |
  | <<unique>> | UNIQUE constraint |
  | <<nullable>> | NULL permitido |
  | <<fwd>> | FK forward diferida — columna sin FK física (ADR-009) |
endlegend

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Entidad raíz
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "person" as t_per {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * first_name : varchar(80)
  * last_name : varchar(80)
  second_last_name : varchar(80) <<nullable>>
  document_type : varchar(20) <<nullable>>
  document_number : varchar(40) <<nullable, indexed>>
  birth_date : date <<nullable>>
  gender : varchar(20) <<nullable>>
  address : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  notes : text <<nullable>>
  --
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Identifiers multicanal
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "person_contact_identifier" as t_pci {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<FK→person, indexed>>
  * channel_type : varchar(40)
  * identifier : varchar(255)
  * is_primary : boolean = false
  * verified : boolean = false
  --
  ' UNIQUE parcial (channel_type, identifier) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Catálogos configurables
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "lead_status" as t_ls {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * code : varchar(40) <<unique>>
  * name : varchar(120)
  description : varchar(500) <<nullable>>
  color : varchar(20) <<nullable>>
  * is_initial : boolean = false
  * is_final : boolean = false
  * is_won : boolean = false
  * display_order : int = 0
  --
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

entity "customer_status" as t_cs {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * code : varchar(40) <<unique>>
  * name : varchar(120)
  description : varchar(500) <<nullable>>
  color : varchar(20) <<nullable>>
  * is_initial : boolean = false
  * is_final : boolean = false
  * display_order : int = 0
  --
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Matriz de transiciones configurable (ADR-008) — PK·A·T, SIN SoftDelete
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "lead_status_transition" as t_lst {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * from_lead_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→lead_status, indexed>>
  * to_lead_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→lead_status>>
  --
  ' UNIQUE (from_lead_status_id, to_lead_status_id)
  ' SIN SoftDelete — config: deshabilitar arista = active=false o DELETE
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

entity "customer_status_transition" as t_cst {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * from_customer_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→customer_status, indexed>>
  * to_customer_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→customer_status>>
  --
  ' UNIQUE (from_customer_status_id, to_customer_status_id)
  ' SIN SoftDelete
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Estado actual (uno solo VIVO por Person — UNIQUE parcial)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "person_lead_status" as t_pls {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<unique parcial, FK→person>>
  * lead_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→lead_status>>
  source_campaign_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, indexed, fwd>>
  * entered_status_at : timestamptz
  last_activity_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  --
  ' UNIQUE parcial (person_id) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL → reabrir = fila nueva
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

entity "person_customer_status" as t_pcs {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<unique parcial, FK→person>>
  * customer_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→customer_status>>
  * became_customer_at : timestamptz
  * entered_status_at : timestamptz
  --
  ' UNIQUE parcial (person_id) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Historial inmutable — PK·A·T, SIN SoftDelete
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "lead_status_history" as t_lsh {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<FK→person, indexed>>
  from_lead_status_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→lead_status>>
  * to_lead_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→lead_status>>
  source_campaign_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, indexed, fwd>>
  * changed_at : timestamptz
  changed_by : varchar(36) <<nullable>>
  reason : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  --
  ' SIN SoftDelete — historial inmutable (auditoría honesta)
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

entity "customer_status_history" as t_csh {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<FK→person, indexed>>
  from_customer_status_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→customer_status>>
  * to_customer_status_id : varchar(36) <<FK→customer_status>>
  * changed_at : timestamptz
  changed_by : varchar(36) <<nullable>>
  reason : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  --
  ' SIN SoftDelete — historial inmutable
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Asignación de owner (UNIQUE parcial por Person)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "lead_assignment" as t_la {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<unique parcial, FK→person>>
  * advisor_user_id : varchar(36) <<FK→user, indexed>>
  * assigned_at : timestamptz
  assigned_by : varchar(36) <<nullable>>
  reason : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  --
  ' UNIQUE parcial (person_id) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Timeline polimórfico — PK·A·T, SIN SoftDelete
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "lead_activity" as t_act {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<FK→person, indexed>>
  advisor_user_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→user>>
  * activity_type : varchar(40)
  content : text <<nullable>>
  scheduled_for : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  completed_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  outcome : varchar(40) <<nullable>>
  payload : jsonb <<nullable>>
  related_appointment_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, indexed, fwd>>
  related_conversation_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, indexed, fwd>>
  --
  ' SIN SoftDelete — "borrar" = active=false (la fila queda)
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Entidad externa (referencia) — admin.user YA existe
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "user" as t_user <<external>> #lightgrey {
  ' Módulo: admin
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  ...
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Relaciones (crow's foot)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

' Person como hub
t_per ||--o{ t_pci  : "identifiers\nmulticanal"
t_per ||--o| t_pls  : "lead actual\n(UNIQUE parcial)"
t_per ||--o| t_pcs  : "cliente actual\n(UNIQUE parcial)"
t_per ||--o| t_la   : "owner\n(UNIQUE parcial)"
t_per ||--o{ t_lsh  : "historial lead"
t_per ||--o{ t_csh  : "historial customer"
t_per ||--o{ t_act  : "timeline\nactivity"

' Estado actual → catálogo
t_ls ||--o{ t_pls : "estado lead"
t_cs ||--o{ t_pcs : "estado cliente"

' Historiales → catálogos (to / from)
t_ls ||--o{ t_lsh : "to / from"
t_cs ||--o{ t_csh : "to / from"

' Matriz de transiciones → catálogo (from / to)
t_ls ||--o{ t_lst : "from / to\n(arista permitida)"
t_cs ||--o{ t_cst : "from / to\n(arista permitida)"

' Owner → User (advisor) + actor de la actividad
t_user ||--o{ t_la  : "advisor"
t_user ||--o{ t_act : "actor (opcional)"

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Notas
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

note right of t_per
  **Sin datos médicos en MVP**
  Identidad + contacto. ""phone""/""email""
  NO son columnas — viven en
  ""person_contact_identifier"" (multicanal).
  Si crece la necesidad médica se agregará
  ""medical_record"" (1:1 con Person) aparte.
end note

note right of t_pci
  **Dedup multicanal**
  UNIQUE PARCIAL ""(channel_type, identifier)""
  WHERE ""deleted_at IS NULL"" → permite
  reasignar el handle tras soft-delete.
  Violación → ""IDENTIFIER_TAKEN"" (409).
  Base del matching de ""conversations""
  al recibir un mensaje entrante.
end note

note bottom of t_pls
  **Un único lead VIVO por Person**
  UNIQUE PARCIAL ""(person_id)"" WHERE
  ""deleted_at IS NULL"". Al transicionar a un
  estado ""is_final"" la fila se SOFT-DELETEA
  (la traza queda en ""lead_status_history"");
  **reabrir = fila nueva**.
end note

note right of t_ls
  **Catálogo configurable**
  Admin agrega/edita sin deploy.
  Flags ""is_initial"" (exactamente uno),
  ""is_final"", ""is_won"" (⟹ ""is_final"").
  El código no hardcodea códigos.
end note

note bottom of t_lst
  **Matriz de transiciones (ADR-008)**
  Aristas ""from → to"" permitidas del grafo
  de estados. UNIQUE ""(from, to)"". Seedeada
  con base + editable por admin.
  ""PK·A·T"" SIN SoftDelete (config, no dato):
  deshabilitar arista = ""active=false"" o DELETE.
  El service rechaza la arista ausente con
  ""LEAD_TRANSITION_NOT_ALLOWED"" (400).
end note

note bottom of t_la
  **Round-robin sin tabla extra**
  UNIQUE PARCIAL ""(person_id)"" — un solo owner.
  Auto: ""advisors (role=ASESOR) ORDER BY""
  ""COUNT(leads activos) ASC, MAX(assigned_at)""
  ""ASC LIMIT 1"" + ""FOR UPDATE"" (evita race).
  Reasignar = soft-delete + insert nueva +
  ""LeadActivity(REASSIGNED)"" en una tx.
  ""advisor_user_id"" SÍ es FK física a ""user"";
  ""assigned_by"" NULL/""SYSTEM"" si auto.
end note

note right of t_act
  **Timeline polimórfico**
  ""activity_type"" enum CERRADO en código
  (no catálogo BD): contratos con módulos
  futuros (""MESSAGE_SENT"", ""APPOINTMENT_*""…).
  ""payload jsonb"" guarda lo específico del tipo.
  ""PK·A·T"" SIN SoftDelete — "borrar" = ""active=false"".
end note

note bottom of t_lsh
  **Inmutable (auditoría honesta)**
  ""PK·A·T"" SIN SoftDelete. Cada transición
  agrega fila; ""from_lead_status_id"" es NULL
  en la primera (creación). ""changed_by"" puede
  ser NULL/""SYSTEM"" si fue automática.
end note

note as N_FWD
  **FKs forward diferidas (ADR-009)**
  Estas 3 columnas son ""varchar(36)"" nullable
  **indexadas SIN FK física** — las tablas
  ""campaign""/""appointment""/""conversation"" aún
  NO existen, declarar el ""ForeignKey"" rompería
  la migración/el mapper. La constraint (+ el
  ""relationship"") la agrega de forma ADITIVA el
  módulo dueño cuando crea su tabla:
  • ""person_lead_status.source_campaign_id"" → marketing.campaign
  • ""lead_status_history.source_campaign_id"" → marketing.campaign
  • ""lead_activity.related_appointment_id"" → scheduling.appointment
  • ""lead_activity.related_conversation_id"" → conversations.conversation
end note
N_FWD .. t_pls
N_FWD .. t_act

note as N_USER
  **FKs lógicas a ""user"" (admin)**
  ""changed_by"" (historiales) y ""assigned_by""
  (lead_assignment) son strings sin constraint:
  pueden ser el user técnico **SYSTEM**
  (""system@medisage.internal"", ""active=false"",
  no autenticable) que crm introduce en F0 como
  actor de las operaciones automáticas
  (""find_by_identifier_or_create"", transiciones
  y round-robin disparados por sistema).
end note
N_USER .. t_user

@enduml
